# Who must approve a change before it merges into main.
#
# The owner decides; Claude executes (CLAUDE.md § How a component gets made). These paths are where a
# decision lives or where the rules that enforce decisions live, so a change to any of them is a
# ruling, and only the owner makes rulings. GitHub enforces it once the main ruleset has "Require
# review from Code Owners" on, with the owner as a bypass actor so he can still merge his own.
# (Design Hub D48, 21 Oct 2026.)
#
# Everything not listed here merges as today.

# Rulings and the brand framework
/docs/decisions/   @devagya-tc
/docs/brand/       @devagya-tc

# The rules every session loads
/CLAUDE.md         @devagya-tc

# Agent setup: commands, skills, agents, hooks, shared settings
/.claude/          @devagya-tc

# The checks and the scripts behind them
/scripts/          @devagya-tc
/package.json      @devagya-tc
/package-lock.json @devagya-tc

# Who owns what
/.github/CODEOWNERS @devagya-tc
